---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    Computer Science and Applied Math double major at the University of Southern California (GPA 3.88). 
    Passionate about Machine Learning, agentic frameworks, and green learning. 
    Experienced in building production-ready RAG pipelines, LLM-based simulations, and full-stack applications.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.S. Computer Science | Applied Math (Double Major)"
      subtitle="Expected May 2027 at University of Southern California, Los Angeles, CA"
    >
      GPA: 3.88 <br />
      Relevant Coursework: Algorithms, Data Structures, Software Engineering, Machine Learning, Linear Algebra, Probability and Statistics, Data Science.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Machine Learning Engineer Intern"
      subtitle="Oct 2025 - Present at Currents AI"
    >
      - Building LLM-based Celebrity Simulator to simulate top 100 political/business figures' decision making using post-training pipelines and agentic frameworks.<br/>
      - Establishing a post-training pipeline with data collection/processing, Supervised Fine Tuning (SFT) on Qwen, and RL with generator-discriminator framework.<br/>
      - Participating in company’s web agent extension launching, test script writing, and marketing planning.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Engineer Intern"
      subtitle="June 2024 - Aug 2024 at Alibaba Cloud"
    >
      - Pioneered the industry’s first RAG multi-hop question set auto-generator for Chinese finance sector, improving retrieval accuracy by 20%.<br/>
      - Developed a Knowledge Graph (Neo4j), vector embedding, and prompt engineering based auto-generation Python pipeline.<br/>
      - Applied pipeline on Alibaba’s finance AI assistant Qwen Dianjin, improving product satisfaction among 30+ leading financial companies.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Research Assistant (Social Simulation & RL)"
      subtitle="May 2025 - Present at USC HUMANS Lab"
    >
      - Contributing to WWW2026 submission on simulating LLM-driven influence operations using multi-agent generative modeling.<br/>
      - Implemented GABM of 50 agents using AutoGen and Llama 3.3-70B.<br/>
      - Researching RL application on multi-agent social media simulation to improve engagement rates.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Research Assistant (Green Learning)"
      subtitle="May 2025 - Present at USC Media Communication Lab"
    >
      - Conducting research on Green Learning—an explainable, energy-efficient alternative to deep learning.<br/>
      - Surveyed and reproduced 10+ papers on standard vision benchmarks.<br/>
      - Researching application of Green Learning pipeline on Policy Gradient for high interpretability and efficiency.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Project Lead (Alzheimer's Diagnostic)"
      subtitle="2021 - 2022"
    >
      - Improved Early AD diagnosis accuracy to >85% using SVM on patient plasma protein data.<br/>
      - Published in 2022 IEEE 2nd International Conference on Data Science and Computer Application (ICDSCA).
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Python (NumPy, Pandas, PyTorch)</li>
    <li>C++</li>
    <li>Java</li>
    <li>MATLAB</li>
    <li>React</li>
    <li>Node.js</li>
    <li>Next.js</li>
    <li>TypeScript</li>
    <li>Spring Boot</li>
    <li>MySQL</li>
    <li>Git</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>FastAPI</li>
    <li>MangoDB</li>
    <li>Neo4j</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
